OL,3,AUK and EU agree new deal for food
OL,4,Aexports, youth mobility and emissions
OL,5,Abut student fee talks to continue
OL,6,
OL,7,FPM Andy Burnham calls it a "historic
OL,8,Fmoment", saying people in the UK want a
OL,9,F"better deal" with the EU than the
OL,10,F"hard Brexit we ended up with";
OL,11,FPresident of the European Commission
OL,12,FUrsula von der Leyen says it's a "big
OL,13,Fsuccess"
OL,15,FSpeaking to the BBC earlier, Reform's
OL,16,FNigel Farage - a prominent Brexit
OL,17,Fcampaigner - said the PM has no
OL,18,F"democratic mandate to do any of this"
OL,19,F- here's what other political leaders
OL,20,Fhave said
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
