OL,3,AWhite House removes cyber-security
OL,4,Achief after series of tech outages
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe top cyber-security official in the
OL,7,FUS government is leaving his post after
OL,8,Fa little over a year in the job, US
OL,9,Fmedia report.
OL,11,FCBS, the BBC's US news partner, and
OL,12,Fother media report that White House
OL,13,FNational Cyber Director Sean Cairncross
OL,14,Fhas been fired after losing the
OL,15,Fconfidence of White House chief of
OL,16,Fstaff Stephen Miller.
OL,18,FIt comes after a string of tech outages
OL,19,Fwhich hit banking, air traffic control
OL,20,Fand other sectors.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
